%%{init: {'theme': 'default'}}%%
%% =================================================================
%% SEQUENCE DIAGRAM
%% Proses Transaksi Penjualan
%% Sistem Informasi Inventori dan Penjualan - LKTech
%% =================================================================

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Staff as 👤 Staff / Admin
    participant Browser as 🌐 Browser
    participant SaleCtrl as SaleController
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database
    participant ProductCtrl as ProductController
    participant ActivityLog as ActivityLog

    Note over Staff, ActivityLog: ══ FASE 1: MEMBUAT TRANSAKSI ══

    Staff ->> Browser: Buka Menu Penjualan → Klik "Buat Transaksi"
    Browser ->> SaleCtrl: GET /sales/create
    SaleCtrl ->> DB: SELECT customers, products (status=available)
    DB -->> SaleCtrl: Data Pelanggan & Produk
    SaleCtrl -->> Browser: Tampilkan Form Penjualan
    Browser -->> Staff: Form Transaksi Siap

    Staff ->> Browser: Pilih Pelanggan + Pilih Produk + Qty + Harga
    Browser ->> SaleCtrl: POST /sales (form data)

    Note over SaleCtrl, DB: ══ FASE 2: VALIDASI & SIMPAN DATA ══

    SaleCtrl ->> SaleCtrl: Validasi Input (required fields)
    SaleCtrl ->> DB: Cek stok produk yang dipilih
    DB -->> SaleCtrl: Data Stok

    alt Stok Tidak Cukup
        SaleCtrl -->> Browser: ❌ Redirect back + Error: "Stok Tidak Cukup"
        Browser -->> Staff: Tampilkan pesan error
    else Stok Tersedia
        SaleCtrl ->> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        SaleCtrl ->> DB: INSERT INTO sales (user_id, customer_id, total, payment_method, ...)
        DB -->> SaleCtrl: Sale ID

        loop Untuk Setiap Produk
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: INSERT INTO sale_details (sale_id, product_id, qty, price, profit)
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: UPDATE products SET stock = stock - qty
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: UPDATE products SET status = 'sold' (jika stok = 0)
        end

        SaleCtrl ->> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        SaleCtrl ->> ActivityLog: Log: create_sale (user_id, sale_id, IP)

        Note over SaleCtrl, DB: ══ FASE 3: PROSES PEMBAYARAN ══

        alt Pembayaran Tunai
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: UPDATE sales SET payment_status = 'success'
            SaleCtrl -->> Browser: ✅ Redirect ke /sales/{id}
            Browser -->> Staff: Detail Transaksi + Tombol Cetak Invoice
        else Pembayaran Transfer / QRIS
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: UPDATE sales SET payment_status = 'pending'
            SaleCtrl -->> Browser: ✅ Redirect ke /sales/{id}
            Browser -->> Staff: Detail Transaksi (Status: Menunggu Konfirmasi)

            Staff ->> Browser: Cek Bukti Transfer → Klik "Tandai Lunas"
            Browser ->> SaleCtrl: POST /sales/{sale}/mark-paid
            SaleCtrl ->> DB: UPDATE sales SET payment_status = 'success'
            SaleCtrl ->> ActivityLog: Log: mark_paid (user_id, sale_id)
            SaleCtrl -->> Browser: ✅ Status Updated
        end

        Note over Staff, Browser: ══ FASE 4: CETAK INVOICE ══

        Staff ->> Browser: Klik "Cetak Invoice"
        Browser ->> SaleCtrl: GET /sales/{sale}/invoice
        SaleCtrl ->> DB: SELECT sale, sale_details, customer, products
        DB -->> SaleCtrl: Data Lengkap Transaksi
        SaleCtrl -->> Browser: ✅ Generate PDF Invoice
        Browser -->> Staff: Invoice Siap Diunduh / Dicetak
    end
